WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.5 · Theory of Change
Outputs

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Outputs show what you delivered, not whether anyone's life improved.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Give quantity, reach and a quality check.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Make each output something you can verify.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Never report a busy programme as an effective one.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“48 repair cafés a year, about 2,000 items, free and open to all, every electrical repair safety-tested.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your outputs with quantity, reach and quality checks.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
